# Personal/real CV PDFs must NEVER be committed — they contain PII.
# Root-level PDFs and all test fixtures are local-only. Drop your own
# sample CVs into tests/fixtures/ to run the parser regression tests;
# they are skipped automatically when absent.
/*.pdf
/*.PDF
/tests/fixtures/*.pdf
/tests/fixtures/*.PDF

